			"notes": "## 更新内容\n\n- 将`./config/cgccpackloader.json`中的目录列表作为额外的数据包和资源包目录，默认添加 _./tacz/_ 目录\n- 允许该目录下没有`pack.mcmeta`的数据包和资源包正常加载\n\n# English\n\n- Uses the directory list in `./config/cgccpackloader.json` as additional data pack and resource pack directories, with _./tacz/_ added by default\n- Allows data packs and resource packs in this directory without `pack.mcmeta` to load normally\n\n# Release notes\n\n## What's Changed\n* Pack loader by @XColorful in https://github.com/XColorful/CGC-Compat-PackLoader/pull/1\n* Add logo by @XColorful in https://github.com/XColorful/CGC-Compat-PackLoader/pull/2\n\n## New Contributors\n* @XColorful made their first contribution in https://github.com/XColorful/CGC-Compat-PackLoader/pull/1\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/XColorful/CGC-Compat-PackLoader/compare/0.0.0...26.9.1"
